The built-in icon registry `packages/ui/src/components/VIcon/icons.ts` — and the
`dist/components/VIcon/icons.js` built from it — embed SVG path data extracted
from Material Symbols Rounded (weight 400, grade 0, optical size 24). The
extraction is performed by `packages/ui/scripts/build-icons.ts` from a pinned
upstream revision; no other part of Material Symbols is redistributed, and the
library requires no icon font at runtime.

The documentation site embeds a further handful of paths from the same source,
the same revision and the same axes, in `apps/docs/.vitepress/theme/icons.ts`,
extracted by `apps/docs/scripts/build-icons.ts`. They cover the icons the site's
own chrome renders, which the library's registry does not carry; they are part
of the published site, not of the `@vectis/ui` package.

